Here is the root cause:
The rmdir path in cgroup_destroy_locked() included a blocking wait (cgroup_drain_dying) for tasks past exit_signals() to leave the cgroup, causing a deadlock when the reaper (e.g., PID 1) is stuck in rmdir while waiting for those tasks to be reaped, preventing them from exiting.

